namespace UObjectToolTips

DreamWidgetEachBinding {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamWidgetEachBinding.h#DreamWidgetEachBinding
    src   "One `each Item in Source { Template }` block, compiled: which widget hosts the list view, which\nwidget is the cell template, where the items come from, and what each cell writes from its item.\n\nThe runtime resolves it at Initialize the way property bindings are resolved: host and template\nthrough the class properties their ids became, the source through reflection -- a nullary\nUFUNCTION returning TArray<UObject*>, or a TArray<UObject*> variable, whose FieldNotify\nbroadcast (when it has one) is what refreshes the list without anyone calling refresh."
}

DreamWidgetEachBinding:bInPanel {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamWidgetEachBinding.h#DreamWidgetEachBinding:bInPanel
    src   "A `for` rather than an `each`: one copy of the template per item, made inside the host panel itself -- no list\nview, no virtualization, no synthesized content (ContentWidgetName stays None). The template stays in the tree\ncollapsed, and the copies take its place among the host's children, in item order. Run by the core\n(UDreamUIForAdapter); an `each` is run by the list views' module through IDreamUIEachBindingHandler."
    text  "是 `for` 而不是 `each`：每个项一份模板副本，直接在宿主面板内部生成——没有列表\n视图，没有虚拟化，没有合成内容（ContentWidgetName 保持为 None）。模板在树中\n保持折叠，副本按项顺序在宿主的子级中占据它的位置。由核心\n（UDreamUIForAdapter）运行；`each` 则由列表视图控件的模块通过绑定处理器 IDreamUIEachBindingHandler 运行。"
    state machine
}

DreamWidgetEachBinding:bSourceIsFunction {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamWidgetEachBinding.h#DreamWidgetEachBinding:bSourceIsFunction
    src   "Describes SourceName -- the last segment when there is a SourcePath."
    text  "描述 SourceName——存在 SourcePath 时为最后一段。"
    state machine
}

DreamWidgetEachBinding:ContentWidgetName {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamWidgetEachBinding.h#DreamWidgetEachBinding:ContentWidgetName
    src   "The builder-synthesized content widget under the host, by variable name. Carried here because\nthe view's own Content pointer is authored against the ARCHETYPE tree: copied into an\ninstance it still aims at the archetype, and every cell the view cloned landed in the\ninvisible template tree. Resolve re-aims it per instance, exactly as it does the template."
    text  "构建器在宿主下合成的内容控件，按变量名。之所以放在这里，是因为\n视图自身的 Content 指针是针对 ARCHETYPE 树创作的：复制到\n实例中后它仍指向原型，视图克隆的每个单元格都落在\n不可见的模板树里。Resolve 会像处理模板那样，按实例重新指向它。"
    state machine
}

