DreamWidgetEachBinding:SourceLine {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamWidgetEachBinding.h#DreamWidgetEachBinding:SourceLine
    src   "Where the `each` header was written, 1-based, 0 for a block that came from anywhere but a\n.dui -- the same pair FDreamWidgetPropertyBinding and FDreamWidgetEventBinding carry, spelled\nthe same on purpose so one AuthoredLocation helper reads all three.\n\nDUI6006 and DUI6007 are the readers. Both ask whether the SOURCE exists on the class being\ncompiled, which is a question that only has an answer after the class is built and therefore\nlong after the AST that knew this line is gone."
    text  "`each` 头部的书写位置，从 1 开始计数，0 表示该块来自 .dui 以外的任何位置——\n与 FDreamWidgetPropertyBinding（控件属性绑定）和 FDreamWidgetEventBinding（控件事件绑定）携带的是同一对字段，故意\n拼写相同，以便一个 AuthoredLocation 辅助函数读取这三者。\n\nDUI6006 和 DUI6007 是读取方。二者都询问正在编译的类上是否存在 SOURCE，这个问题\n只有在类构建完成之后才有答案，因此\n远在知晓此行的 AST 已被丢弃之后。"
    state machine
}

DreamWidgetEachBinding:SourceName {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamWidgetEachBinding.h#DreamWidgetEachBinding:SourceName
    src   "Function or variable on the user widget supplying TArray<UObject*>. With SourcePath, its LAST segment."
}

DreamWidgetEachBinding:SourcePath {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamWidgetEachBinding.h#DreamWidgetEachBinding:SourcePath
    src   "Set when the source is a member path (`in Inventory.Items`, `in Inventory.Filtered()`): every segment, the last\nequal to SourceName. Empty for the one-segment source every loop had before, which reads SourceName on the user\nwidget exactly as it always did. Items are read through DreamUIBindingPath (ResolveOwner, then ReadObjectArray), and\nthe owning widget refreshes the adapter when anything along the path changes (an FDreamUIBindingObserver client)."
    text  "当源是成员路径（`in Inventory.Items`、`in Inventory.Filtered()`）时设置：包含每一个段，最后一段\n等于 SourceName。对于以前每个循环都有的单段源则为空，这种源会像以往一样在用户\n控件上读取 SourceName。项通过绑定路径 DreamUIBindingPath 读取（先 ResolveOwner，再 ReadObjectArray），并且\n当路径上任何内容变化时，所属控件会刷新适配器（一个 FDreamUIBindingObserver 客户端）。"
    state machine
}

