DreamWidgetEntryRoute {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamWidgetEachBinding.h#DreamWidgetEntryRoute
    src   "One `Event -> Item.Func` line inside a loop body: the event, on which widget of the copy (or cell), routed to a\nfunction of THAT copy's item. Bound per copy by the adapter -- a `for` when it makes or re-aims a copy, an `each` at\nSetCell, unbinding the previous item first when a cell is recycled -- never on the class, which has no item.\n\nThe function takes nothing, or exactly what the event sends (bCallWithoutArguments says which the author wrote:\n`-> Item.Use()` or `-> Item.Use`). Checked by the compiler when the source's element class is known\n(LoopItemRouteMismatch); against an array of UObject only at run time, where a function that fits neither way is\nskipped."
    text  "循环体中的一行`Event -> Item.Func`：事件，位于副本（或单元格）的哪个控件上，路由到\n该副本项的某个函数。由适配器按副本绑定——当它创建或重新对准副本时为`for`，在\nSetCell时为`each`，回收单元格时先解除与上一项的绑定——从不在类上绑定，因为类没有项。\n\n该函数不接收参数，或恰好接收事件发送的内容（bCallWithoutArguments表示作者写的是哪种：\n`-> Item.Use()`或`-> Item.Use`）。当源的元素类已知时由编译器检查\n（LoopItemRouteMismatch）；对于UObject数组仅在运行时检查，此时两种方式都不匹配的函数会被\n跳过。"
    state machine
}

DreamWidgetEntryRoute:bCallWithoutArguments {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamWidgetEachBinding.h#DreamWidgetEntryRoute:bCallWithoutArguments
    src   "`-> Item.Func()`: call with no arguments. Without the parentheses the event's own arguments are forwarded."
    text  "`-> Item.Func()`：调用时不带参数。不加括号时，会转发事件自身的参数。"
    state machine
}

DreamWidgetEntryRoute:EventName {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamWidgetEachBinding.h#DreamWidgetEntryRoute:EventName
    src   "A BlueprintAssignable multicast delegate, an FDreamUIEventDelegate property, or a single-cast delegate -- the three\nkinds a route names. A single-cast one is SET to the item's function (its one slot), the others are appended to."
    text  "蓝图可赋值（BlueprintAssignable）多播委托、FDreamUIEventDelegate 属性，或单播委托——路由可指定的三\n种类型。单播委托会被 SET 为条目的函数（它唯一的槽位），其余类型则追加。"
    state machine
}

